      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاتَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَخِيتُ</span>, (IAar,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَيْتٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُيُوتٌ</span>, (IAar, K,) and inf. n. of un. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَيْتَةٌ</span>, (IAar,)
<i>He made a sound,</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَوَّتَ</span>; (IAar, K;*) [app.
<i>with his wings, in pouncing down,</i> or <i>making a
stoop;</i> see 1 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خوت</span>;] said of a bird. (IAar.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاتَهُ مَالَهُ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَخِيتُهُ</span>: see 1 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خوت</span>.

